<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Plexus lowered on price.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Plexus lowered on price.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Stephens Inc said it downgraded Plexus Corp to buy from strong buy, citing the stock's recent price rise and a signifcantly higher price to earnings multiple.</p>
<p>-- set new 12-month price target of $62.</p>
<p>-- shares were off 2-13/16 to 53.  </p>
<p>-- said the stock has appreciated 97 percent since May 1 and trades at 29 times Stephens's earnings per share estimate of $1.86. for the fiscal year ending September 1997.</p>
</text>
